    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Schedule a daily post to X, Bluesky, and Mastodon\n\n### How it works\n\n1. Runs automatically every day.\n2. Publishes posts to X (Twitter), Bluesky, and Mastodon via the SocialRobot API.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- [ ] Install the SocialRobot community node and connect your SocialRobot API credential (API key: socialrobot.io, Scheduler -> API Keys).\n- [ ] Select your connected SocialRobot account in each Publish node.\n- [ ] Replace the example captions in the Publish nodes with your own text.\n\n### Customization\n\nChange the schedule interval to control how often the workflow runs. Remove the Publish nodes you do not need to target fewer platforms. Adjust the trigger interval to control exactly how often the workflow runs. Everything runs inside your own n8n workspace, so you can change any step after import.",
        "width": 480,
        "height": 568
      },
